 ```
 
+##### limit
+
+The maximum number of ranges to take from one header. When the header has more
+ranges than `limit` (after `combine`, if enabled), they are replaced by a single
+range from the lowest start to the highest end. Defaults to no limit.
+
+<!-- eslint-disable no-undef -->
+
+```js
+parseRange(100, 'bytes=0-1,10-11,50-60', { limit: 2 })
+// => [{ start: 0, end: 60 }]
+```
+
